WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.970
Hello again, champ!

2
00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:14.980
Building on Chapter 1

3
00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:21.820
Chapter 2 · How Computers Understand Us

4
00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:31.310
Say with me: How Computers Understand Us

5
00:00:31.310 --> 00:00:36.790
Let's open the secret!

6
00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:45.410
Computers don't speak like us…

7
00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:50.790
How do they understand us?

8
00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:59.790
⏸ Your turn — make a guess!

9
00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:05.270
We'll prove it with switches

10
00:01:05.270 --> 00:01:14.130
Big idea: only TWO states

11
00:01:14.130 --> 00:01:20.280
Like a light switch: ON or OFF

12
00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:27.510
Say: On… or off!

13
00:01:27.510 --> 00:01:34.210
ON = 1 · OFF = 0

14
00:01:34.210 --> 00:01:40.670
1 = on · 0 = off · Easy!

15
00:01:40.670 --> 00:01:47.800
Three switches in a row

16
00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:55.220
Each switch = 1 or 0

17
00:01:55.220 --> 00:02:02.140
off off on → 0 0 1

18
00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:08.430
on off on → 1 0 1

19
00:02:08.430 --> 00:02:17.670
Binary = language of TWO

20
00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:26.720
Binary = light-switch language

21
00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:35.270
Your turn — read the lights!

22
00:02:35.270 --> 00:02:44.860
Pattern 1: 0 0 1

23
00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:54.240
Pattern 2: 1 1 0

24
00:02:54.240 --> 00:03:03.570
Pattern 3: 1 0 1

25
00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:10.630
Super! Tiny bits of information

26
00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:15.650
Practice check

27
00:03:15.650 --> 00:03:23.090
What does 1 0 1 mean?

28
00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:28.110
Think: left · middle · right

29
00:03:28.110 --> 00:03:37.350
Answer: ON · OFF · ON ✓

30
00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:46.910
Photos, games, messages → 0s & 1s

31
00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:56.150
Words ↔ on/off ↔ pictures & sound

32
00:03:56.150 --> 00:04:03.020
Binary = light-switch language!

33
00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:12.480
ON = 1 · OFF = 0

34
00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:18.770
Binary = the computer's language

35
00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:25.060
101 → on, off, on

36
00:04:25.060 --> 00:04:32.100
Chapter 2 complete!

37
00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:41.200
